<view class="page">
  <view class="hero interpret-hero"><text class="eyebrow">以星为镜 · 由你选择</text><text class="title">让星图，更好懂</text><text class="subtitle">把宫位和星曜，转成可观察的生活提示。</text></view>
  <view class="topic-list"><text wx:for="{{topics}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag">{{item}}</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!hasChart}}" class="card interpret-empty"><text class="card-title">先起一张命盘</text><text class="muted">输入出生日期、时辰和性别。启用 AI 服务后可查看五个维度的文化解读。</text><button class="button button-secondary" bindtap="onStart">去排盘</button></view>
  <view wx:else class="card interpret-controls">
    <text class="card-title">本次解读的命盘</text><text class="chart-summary">{{chartSummary}}</text>
    <view wx:if="{{!configured}}" class="notice">AI 解读暂未启用，需要部署并配置 AI 服务。当前可在本机排盘、查看星曜和保存历史。</view>
    <block wx:if="{{configured}}">
      <view class="token-heading"><text class="label">AI 访问口令</text><text class="muted token-note">由部署者提供</text></view>
      <input class="token-input" password="{{true}}" value="{{token}}" maxlength="512" placeholder="不是模型 API Key" placeholder-class="token-placeholder" bindinput="onTokenInput" disabled="{{busy}}" />
      <text class="muted token-hint">口令只在当前页面内存中使用，离开页面即清空。</text>
      <checkbox-group bindchange="onConsentChange"><label class="consent-row"><checkbox value="consent" checked="{{consent}}" color="#d4b880" disabled="{{busy}}" /><text>同意将出生日期、时辰、性别和所选流年发送至配置的服务端。服务端重新排盘后，将结构化命盘发送给 {{providerName}} 生成本次解读。</text></label></checkbox-group>
      <button class="button interpret-generate" bindtap="onInterpret" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!consent || !token || busy}}">{{busy ? '正在解读星图…' : '生成 AI 解读'}}</button>
      <text wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted progress-message">正在整理十二宫、四化与流年，请稍候。切换页面将取消本次等待。</text>
    </block>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{analysis}}" class="analysis-results">
    <view wx:for="{{analysis.sections}}" wx:key="topic" class="card analysis-section">
      <text class="eyebrow">{{item.topic}}观察</text><text class="analysis-summary">{{item.summary}}</text><text class="analysis-subheading">命盘线索</text>
      <view wx:for="{{item.observations}}" wx:for-item="observation" wx:key="*this" class="analysis-item"><text class="analysis-dot">·</text><text>{{observation}}</text></view>
      <text class="analysis-subheading">可以尝试</text><view wx:for="{{item.suggestions}}" wx:for-item="suggestion" wx:key="*this" class="analysis-item"><text class="analysis-dot">·</text><text>{{suggestion}}</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="notice">{{analysis.notice}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice interpret-disclaimer">仅供传统文化学习与自我观察，非科学预测。AI 可能理解有误，不用于医疗、投资或婚姻等重大决策。AI 解读需联网，当前国内方案使用智谱免费模型，仍受平台限流和当期政策约束。</view>
</view>
